@title Route options for the east corridor

Three ways to move more people along Route 9. Cards of prose and bullets stay in the text column; only cards holding a chart or table break out.

cards
### Enhanced bus
More frequent buses and signal priority at lights.
- Capital cost: $85M
- Build time: 2 years

### Bus rapid transit
Dedicated lanes and stations.
- Capital cost: $310M
- Build time: 4 years
- Weekday riders by 2035: 26,000

### Light rail
- Capital cost: $940M
- Build time: 8 years
Questions: [route9-corridor-study@transportation.riverbend.example](mailto:route9-corridor-study@transportation.riverbend.example)
